<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Advertise on Food Packaging</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    header { background: #004aad; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
    section { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .cta { background: #f0f0f0; text-align: center; padding: 30px; }
    .cta a { background: #004aad; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
    .features, .pricing { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; }
    .card { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; max-width: 300px; }
    footer { background: #333; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
    form input, form textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Advertise on Food Packaging</h1>
    <p>Reach thousands of kitchens, retailers, and restaurants across India.</p>
  </header>  <section class="features">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Massive Reach</h3>
      <p>Your ad printed on aluminum foil and butter paper, seen daily in kitchens.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Cost-Effective</h3>
      <p>Target thousands of B2B customers at low cost per view.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Pan-India Delivery</h3>
      <p>Your ad travels with our products to every corner of the country.</p>
    </div>
  </section>  <section class="pricing">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Starter</h3>
      <p>10,000 prints</p>
      <p>Rs. 3,999</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Growth</h3>
      <p>50,000 prints</p>
      <p>Rs. 17,500</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Scale</h3>
      <p>1 Lakh+ prints</p>
      <p>Rs. 30,000+</p>
    </div>
  </section>  <section class="cta">
    <h2>Ready to Promote Your Business?</h2>
    <p>Fill the form and we'll get back to you!</p>
    <form>
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required />
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required />
      <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="Phone Number" required />
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Your Message / Ad Inquiry" rows="4"></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>
  </section>  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 AdPrint Packaging. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
